<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus tenders for 25,000 tonnes of barley.</title>
<headline>Cyprus tenders for 25,000 tonnes of barley.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus grain commission has invited tenders for one cargo of 25,000 tonnes of barley for shipment in May, the commission said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Tenders would be examined on May 2, the commission said in a statement.</p>
</text>
